---
title: Test runner lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Compile
    Compile --> Skip: skip true
    Compile --> Ready: ok
    Compile --> Error: bad DSL
    Ready --> Execute
    Execute --> Assert
    Execute --> Retry: transport error and retries left
    Retry --> Execute
    Assert --> Pass
    Assert --> Fail
    Pass --> [*]
    Fail --> [*]
    Skip --> [*]
    Error --> [*]
